---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="ExpatWon publishes general information about money in Korea. It is not financial, legal, tax, or immigration advice."
>
  <article class="prose-article mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="mb-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink">Disclaimer</h1>

    <h2>General information, not advice</h2>
    <p>
      Everything published on ExpatWon.com — articles, calculators, and
      examples — is general information for educational purposes. It is not
      financial, investment, legal, tax, or immigration advice, and it does
      not account for your personal circumstances. Before acting on anything
      you read here, confirm the current rules with the official institution
      involved or consult a licensed professional in Korea.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy and currency</h2>
    <p>
      Korean regulations, fees, interest rates, and bank policies change
      frequently. Each article displays a "last verified" date and links to
      its official sources. Information was accurate to the best of our
      knowledge on that date, but we make no guarantee that it remains
      current, complete, or applicable to your situation.
    </p>

    <h2>Calculators</h2>
    <p>
      The calculators on this site produce estimates using simplified,
      standard formulas. Real quotes from banks, lessors, and insurers include
      fees, credit assessments, and conditions these tools cannot model. Never
      treat a calculator result as an offer or a guaranteed figure.
    </p>

    <h2>Exchange rates</h2>
    <p>
      USD figures are rough conversions at a manually updated reference rate
      and exist only to give non-Korean readers a sense of scale. Actual
      exchange rates vary continuously.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links and advertising</h2>
    <p>
      Some pages contain affiliate links, which are disclosed on the page, and
      display advertising. Compensation never determines what we write or how
      we describe a product. We do not accept payment for positive coverage.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, ExpatWon.com and its author
      accept no liability for any loss or damage arising from reliance on
      information published on this site.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
